# Scribe's intermediate extraction files. Not committed: they record the
# Authorization header used for the response calls, so each generation writes a
# real-looking bearer token into them. The published docs in public/docs are
# committed and contain no token; regenerate from DocsExampleSeeder.
/.scribe

# The API key minted to capture real responses in the docs. Local only.
